{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Understanding", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just trying to process everything lately.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 71}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, just trying to keep up. Haven't decided if I'm ready to talk about it all yet.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 84}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel really hectic. Work has been busy, and at home... well, things haven't gotten easier.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, just trying to keep up. Work is hectic, and at home... I’ve been worried about the baby and my wife. It’s all a bit much.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Thanks for checking in. I think I need to focus on stabilizing things at work first. Let's talk again when I have a clearer head.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 129}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Same worries, just trying to hold on.", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "The arguments and the divorce talk—same stuff, just hard to keep my head above water.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel... shaky, I guess. Same worries, just trying to hold on.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "The worst part is not knowing if we can fix things or if we should. It's paralyzing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 84}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just a lot on my mind, I guess.", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 67}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "The divorce feels like it's throwing everything off. And with the baby, I'm scared of doing the wrong thing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's tough. Mostly just worry about the baby and the whole divorce thing. Feels like I'm not in control.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 104}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261007T111610Z", "last_updated_at": "20261007T113502Z", "first_seen_session": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000251-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
